      "content": "wait what? what do you mean \"keep your eyes peeled for a goblin\"? i'm just trying to fix a sink, not hunt for creatures. \n\ncan you just tell me the actual steps to clean out the P-trap? i'm worried about making a huge mess if i unscrew it.",
